      "problem": "Divide $4 \\div \\dfrac 1 {5} .$",
      "worked_solution": "Dividing a whole number by a fraction is equivalent to multiplying the whole number by the reciprocal of the fraction.\n\nThe reciprocal of $\\dfrac{1}{\\color{blue}5}$ is $\\color{blue}5.$ \n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n4\\div \\dfrac1{\\color{blue}5} = 4\\times  {\\color{blue}5} =20.\n$$",
